  "instructions": [
    "Soak the khus khus in water for at least 4 hours.",
    "Drain and rinse the khus khus.",
    "In a blender, combine the Jamaican cure, tamarind paste, coconut milk, and green chili peppers.",
    "Blend until smooth and creamy.",
    "Add the soaked khus khus, scallions, and salt and pepper to taste to the blender.",
    "Blend until well combined.",
    "Heat a non-stick pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the blended mixture to the pan and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Warm the ti-leaf wraps by wrapping them in a damp cloth and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the wraps by spooning the khus khus mixture onto the center of each wrap.",
    "Top with fresh cilantro and fold the wraps to enclose.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
